# Google Places API credentials, used to show live Google reviews on the
# homepage and Testimonials page (see src/lib/googleReviews.ts).
# Without these set, the site falls back to the hardcoded sample testimonials.
#
# 1. Create/select a project at https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Enable "Places API (New)" for that project
# 3. Create an API key (APIs & Services > Credentials) and restrict it to
#    the Places API (New) only - this key is used server-side, so an
#    HTTP referrer restriction will NOT work; use an API restriction instead
#    and keep this value out of version control.
# 4. Find your Place ID at https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=
